5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help get this sorted. I really want us to have a clear picture of our finances this time so we aren't just guessing. I'll check the ledger and bank statements!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree that clarity is essential. I'm interested in why some members seem hesitant lately, so I'll look into the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know who's actually showing up and who's doing the heavy lifting. I'll check the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand the administrative burden this puts on the treasurer. I will look into the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to make sure we keep things welcoming for everyone, especially new people! I'll look into the taster evening forms from non-joiners and the minute books from the named-grade years.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Does anyone else think we should look at the mid-year joiners? I'm worried about how we handle people who don't start in January. @Toshio, since you're checking those records, could you let us know if it's a big headache?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is a fair question. I believe understanding the administrative side is just as important as understanding the members' feelings. I look forward to hearing what @Toshio finds regarding those records.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm more worried about the people who pay but never show up. If we just look at the money, we're ignoring the fact that a few of us are doing all the work.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, I understand. However, the effort required to manage those payments is exactly what I am investigating. If the system is too complex, the burden falls on one person regardless of who attends.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I think we should keep an eye on both! If the system is too hard for the treasurer, it might also be scary for new people trying to join. Let's see what we all find!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"That's a great point, @Kenji! I just want to make sure we don't end up in a spot where we're short on funds because we were too optimistic. I'm really hoping the bank statements clear things up!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I hope so too, @Mio. I suspect that the financial structure and the atmosphere of the club are closely linked. If people feel a certain pressure, it often manifests as hesitation to attend.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"Exactly. If the people who actually do the work feel like they're subsidizing people who never show up, that's a problem. I'm sticking with the sign-in sheets and the rota to prove it.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Data is the only way to avoid the guesswork @Mio mentioned. I will focus on the labor costs of the current system to ensure the next treasurer doesn't burn out.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I agree! Let's just make sure we don't forget about the people who haven't joined yet. I'm curious if our current rules are what's stopping them from coming in.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I think we've all got a good plan! I'm glad we're looking at this from so many different angles. Let's dive into the records and see what we find!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Indeed. It is a comprehensive approach. I believe that by combining the financial data with the human element, we will find a sustainable path forward for everyone. I look forward to our next discussion.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready. Let's just make sure we don't ignore the unfairness once the data is in front of us. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We have a clear division of labor for the research. I will examine the records and report back on the administrative reality. Until then.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'm really looking forward to seeing what's in those books. Let's hope we find a way to make the club great for everyone! See you all soon!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
